<title>FRANCE: EU maintains flour export refund at eight Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU maintains flour export refund at eight Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday kept the main wheat flour export refund unchanged at eight Ecus per tonne, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
